> 2. if you want to be able to load compiled plugins at runtime, there's
> no alternative to dynamic linking (by definition).

I think we need the user's compiled *model* to be dynamically loadable via R's dyn.load() function, but I don't know if that requires libstan* to be shared objects. Although, if necessary, we could probably have Rstan make shared objects but not do so for regular stan.

